    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Winter is here, and December is the perfect time to get cozy and hunker down for the holidays. What better way to do so than surfing the streaming platforms for a new show to binge or movie to obsess over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“La Bola Negra,” which has garnered significant attention in its festival run, is one of the anticipated films joining Netflix this month. It follows the late-2010s historian tasked with connecting the pieces between a gay-themed Federico García Lorca play he inherits with the two other plot threads, including a narrative about the tender, illicit relationship between two soldiers on opposing sides of the Spanish Civil War (Guitarricadelafuente and Miguel Bernardeau).",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Netflix",
          "url": "https://variety.com/t/netflix/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Related Stories"
