    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Another anticipated title is the “Pride and Prejudice” TV series reboot exploring the deep relationship between Elizabeth Bennet and Mr. Darcy in a faithful yet fresh adaptation of the classic novel."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "There are also several new holiday films like “The December Breeze” and “In a Holidaze.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From box office surprises, to festive fun, Netflix has a slew of titles joining the platform this month."
